WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:07.162
Healthcare Quality Lab: bounded AI proposals, independent financial checks and explicit review. Synthetic insurance rules only. No model is called during this recording.

00:00:07.242 --> 00:00:14.252
This is an authored control, not a new AI answer. It submits, pays, adjusts and reverses a claim, checking money, ledger, history and accumulators.

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:21.341
Approval binds the inspected case, rule contract and source hashes. A later code or scenario change invalidates the approval.

00:00:22.175 --> 00:00:29.180
The approved case passed through actual HTTP in fresh isolated stores. It did not change the interactive claim ledger.

00:00:29.227 --> 00:00:39.239
These are earlier actual local-model measurements, labeled separately. Raw eligibility and reference-assisted correction are different results; a completed job does not imply a correct model.

00:00:40.626 --> 00:00:50.640
The peer committed a synthetic payment but its acknowledgement timed out. Reconciliation queried the original key: one peer payment, one local ledger entry.

00:00:51.507 --> 00:01:01.523
Duplicate and out-of-order webhooks are deduplicated or ignored. A changed payload is rejected. Webhooks signal reconciliation; they never authorize extra money.

00:01:01.535 --> 00:01:11.539
Inspect the verified release, checksummed source archive and GitHub Actions receipts. This portfolio is a synthetic engineering lab, not a production payer or a healthcare compliance certification.
